  "description_short": "Working oyster farm offering fresh Cape oysters straight from the source with lagoon views.",
  "description_long": "Munro's Cape Oysters is a working oyster farm nestled along the Klein Brak River lagoon in Glentana. This is the real deal — a place where you can taste oysters mere metres from where they're harvested, with the tidal waters of the lagoon stretching out before you. The setting is casual and unpretentious, perfect for anyone who appreciates seafood at its freshest.\n\nThe oysters are the star here, served natural or with simple accompaniments that let their briny sweetness shine. It's an ideal stop for seafood lovers exploring the Garden Route, offering an authentic farm-to-table experience in a beautiful waterside location. The relaxed atmosphere makes it equally good for a quick bite or a leisurely afternoon watching the water.",
